About this show, but even if you don't
play, It must go on.

01:00:34.650 --> 01:00:35.810
You decided to stay.

01:00:36.130 --> 01:00:37.130
You wanna be...

01:00:43.580 --> 01:00:44.440
Do it, do it, do it!

01:00:44.441 --> 01:00:50.820
One more time, tell me just guys to do it!

01:00:51.520 --> 01:00:52.860
Do it, do it, do it!

01:00:52.861 --> 01:00:54.680
Do it, do it, do it!

01:01:08.840 --> 01:01:10.820
Looks like it's right above us!

01:01:11.060 --> 01:01:12.060
Okay, what do I do?

01:01:12.220 --> 01:01:13.280
Should I wait in the vent?

01:01:13.540 --> 01:01:14.540
Now come with me.

01:01:30.450 --> 01:01:32.510
Yes, I'd like to thank the economy.

01:01:35.390 --> 01:01:36.050
I can help.

01:01:36.130 --> 01:01:37.290
No, no, no, no, no!

01:01:37.370 --> 01:01:38.370
I can do this!

01:01:39.190 --> 01:01:41.770
Yes, yes, Paulie Ringwald, I will take you
to the boat.

01:01:41.771 --> 01:01:43.290
Good, good!

01:01:44.330 --> 01:01:45.330
Who's there?

01:01:53.350 --> 01:01:55.170
Ninety-nine old Brad Balloons...

01:01:56.150 --> 01:01:57.230
Oops, almost forgot!

01:02:08.650 --> 01:02:10.550
Shhh, over here!

01:02:12.670 --> 01:02:13.670
Stay close!

01:02:17.130 --> 01:02:18.130
What?

01:02:18.930 --> 01:02:19.930
Dolls!

01:02:19.970 --> 01:02:23.390
Looks like Brad was the only one stupid
enough to buy this junk.

01:02:23.750 --> 01:02:26.710
Oh, I used to have one of these!

01:02:32.780 --> 01:02:33.780
Alright,

01:02:43.030 --> 01:02:44.390
we're getting close.

01:02:45.030 --> 01:02:49.870
From now on, every move must be made with
total precision and purpose.

01:02:52.070 --> 01:02:53.070
Focus!

01:02:53.890 --> 01:02:56.110
We're after the diamond, not the
bubblegum!

01:02:56.810 --> 01:02:57.810
Got it!

01:03:00.910 --> 01:03:01.910
Yum!

01:03:03.550 --> 01:03:04.550
This way!

01:03:05.690 --> 01:03:07.970
And now to put this where it belongs.

01:03:10.370 --> 01:03:10.610
What?

01:03:11.050 --> 01:03:12.170
Look at it, Clive.

01:03:12.650 --> 01:03:13.650
It's beautiful!

01:03:20.190 --> 01:03:21.810
Will you please shut up?

01:03:21.930 --> 01:03:22.930
He's gonna spot us!

01:03:32.370 --> 01:03:32.930
Intruders!

01:03:33.350 --> 01:03:34.350
Intruders!

01:03:35.050 --> 01:03:36.050
Intruders!

01:03:37.410 --> 01:03:39.050
Freeze, dipsticks!

01:03:39.710 --> 01:03:41.670
Gru, there's two of you now?

01:03:42.030 --> 01:03:44.130
Then this will be twice as much fun!

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:53.420
Give me back my diamond!

01:03:53.940 --> 01:03:54.940
Total lockdown!

01:04:39.640 --> 01:04:40.740
We'll see!

01:04:47.740 --> 01:04:49.720
Thank you for saving us!

01:04:50.780 --> 01:04:52.440
Look, we got the diamond!

01:04:52.880 --> 01:04:56.720
And we're going to... Take it to
the AVL and get our jobs back!

01:04:57.600 --> 01:04:57.860
Wait!

01:04:58.080 --> 01:04:58.420
What?

01:04:58.600 --> 01:04:59.620
That's amazing!

01:04:59.840 --> 01:05:06.100
And the best part is, you'll never ever go
behind my back ever again.

01:05:06.840 --> 01:05:07.840
Right, honey bear?

01:05:08.240 --> 01:05:09.240
Yeah, right.

01:05:10.000 --> 01:05:11.000
Lesson learned.

01:05:24.920 --> 01:05:27.180
The girls will start packing and tell them
the good news.

01:05:27.560 --> 01:05:29.240
We're getting our jobs back!

01:05:29.241 --> 01:05:31.460
Yes, yes, go tell the girls!

01:05:33.560 --> 01:05:34.600
No, no way!

01:05:34.680 --> 01:05:36.220
We can't give the diamond back!

01:05:37.020 --> 01:05:38.040
I have to!

01:05:38.320 --> 01:05:39.320
No, you don't!

01:05:39.440 --> 01:05:40.460
Yes, I do!

01:05:40.540 --> 01:05:40.980
Give it!

01:05:41.500 --> 01:05:42.500
No, give it!

01:05:42.800 --> 01:05:43.260
Ow!

01:05:43.660 --> 01:05:44.800
What is wrong with you?

01:05:44.840 --> 01:05:45.940
What is wrong with you?

01:05:46.100 --> 01:05:47.100
You kicked me!

01:05:47.140 --> 01:05:48.400
You lied to me!

01:05:48.560 --> 01:05:53.180
Hey, I would have told you the truth,
but you're too much of a wimp to handle it!

01:05:53.540 --> 01:05:54.720
That's it, I'm out of here.

01:05:55.040 --> 01:05:56.740
