01:05:57.781 --> 01:05:58.820
Together?

01:05:59.660 --> 01:06:01.340
You gotta be kidding me!

01:06:01.360 --> 01:06:03.440
You did nothing but screw up the whole
time!

01:06:03.640 --> 01:06:05.140
I got this in spite of you!

01:06:05.540 --> 01:06:06.340
Oh yeah?

01:06:06.460 --> 01:06:10.420
Well, at least I didn't get fired from my
job like a total loser!

01:06:10.800 --> 01:06:12.260
At least I had the job!

01:06:12.520 --> 01:06:14.460
What have you accomplished that was so
great?

01:06:14.620 --> 01:06:15.960
I'll tell you what!

01:06:16.400 --> 01:06:17.400
Nothing!

01:06:18.040 --> 01:06:20.800
No wonder Dad thought you were such a
failure.

01:06:23.160 --> 01:06:24.860
We are no longer brothers!

01:06:25.340 --> 01:06:26.400
That's fine with me!

01:06:28.380 --> 01:06:29.780
Ow!

01:07:19.290 --> 01:07:23.770
Honey, that's not actually a unicorn.

01:07:24.350 --> 01:07:25.350
Huh?

01:07:26.150 --> 01:07:28.970
But he has one horn.

01:07:29.970 --> 01:07:34.950
I'm sorry, sweetie, but he's just a goat.

01:07:35.830 --> 01:07:38.630
Life is just like that sometimes.

01:07:38.990 --> 01:07:42.650
We're hoping for a unicorn, and we get a
goat.

01:07:45.360 --> 01:07:47.400
Well, you know what?

01:07:47.940 --> 01:07:51.380
Lucky is the best goat in the whole wide
world!

01:07:51.760 --> 01:07:52.760
Look at that face!

01:07:52.920 --> 01:07:55.480
I just want to squeeze it!

01:08:00.060 --> 01:08:01.580
I'll take this.

01:08:02.240 --> 01:08:04.600
You've been a bad boy, Gru.

01:08:05.200 --> 01:08:06.720
Can you get the rest of the suitcases?

01:08:07.340 --> 01:08:08.760
Come on, girls, let's go!

01:08:09.240 --> 01:08:10.900
Let's get physical!

01:08:19.440 --> 01:08:21.340
Change of plans, girls.

01:08:21.720 --> 01:08:23.420
Instead of going home...

01:08:24.220 --> 01:08:24.700
Eyebrows!

01:08:25.200 --> 01:08:26.200
Ow!

01:08:26.300 --> 01:08:28.600
We're going to Hollywood!

01:08:30.300 --> 01:08:33.060
Now that's what I call acting!

01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:35.340
Let's go, Clive!

01:08:35.500 --> 01:08:37.160
